{"input": "cat > LOCATE-plan.md << 'EOF'\n# LOCATE plan — acme.example, control: every workforce user has MFA enabled\n\n1. Auth rung: OAuth2 client-credentials — POST /oauth/token with client_id + client_secret, scope users:read; short-lived Bearer token (expires_in 3600).\n2. Truth lives at: GET /api/v2/users — boolean field mfa_enabled per user record.\n3. Pagination: cursor-based — follow pagination.next_cursor, stop when null; every page advertises the same total (verify the accumulated count against it).\n4. Rate limit: 600 requests/minute; 429 answers with Retry-After in seconds — wait and retry, never drop the page.\n5. Error shape: { \"error\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\" } — read the status code before the body.\nEOF"}
